{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "pc1ygdwwhb0pc8y3", "title": "49.如何解决RAG中的语义鸿沟问题", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h3 data-lake-id=\"cmTfS\" id=\"cmTfS\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue5a82f90\" id=\"ue5a82f90\">一、答题思路</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u9c4c9baa\" id=\"u9c4c9baa\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3eca597c\" id=\"u3eca597c\">在解决RAG（检索增强生成）中的“语义鸿沟”问题时，需从</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufd47c1d1\" id=\"ufd47c1d1\">问题根源分析</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3db37dea\" id=\"u3db37dea\">、</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uef50a2af\" id=\"uef50a2af\">技术解决方案</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub2d78087\" id=\"ub2d78087\">和</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub524d389\" id=\"ub524d389\">实际落地案例</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7b9be65b\" id=\"u7b9be65b\">三个维度展开。语义鸿沟的核心矛盾在于用户查询与检索文档之间的语义断层，导致生成内容偏离需求。以下为系统性解题框架：</span></p><ol list=\"u30ba8d1d\"><li fid=\"uf47fa205\" data-lake-id=\"u83039781\" id=\"u83039781\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7b7b8757\" id=\"u7b7b8757\">问题分析</span></strong></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"ub51301ce\" id=\"ub51301ce\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1752227508104-b91025c0-1c29-4bd7-a139-ba7fbed4b577.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u5951fdc1-d07b-4432-ba7c-8734c31a099%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ue1bb1560-9587-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A542.6666666666666%2C%22height%22%3A253%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A170338%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A814%2C%22originHeight%22%3A379%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%AD%A4%E5%B2%9B%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A563%2C%22y%22%3A72%2C%22width%2