场景定位</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1f01a6a1\" id=\"u1f01a6a1\">：明确语义鸿沟出现的业务场景（如医疗、金融、法律等）。</span></li><li fid=\"ucc971bcd\" data-lake-id=\"u47a8b026\" id=\"u47a8b026\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2be7f26a\" id=\"u2be7f26a\">痛点拆解</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"udd6ab83c\" id=\"udd6ab83c\">：数据孤岛、上下文断裂、时效性不足、跨模态语义失配等。</span></li><li fid=\"ucc971bcd\" data-lake-id=\"u88ebccef\" id=\"u88ebccef\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uad6e0cc7\" id=\"uad6e0cc7\">影响评估</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2d84401f\" id=\"u2d84401f\">：回答准确性下降、用户信任流失、业务决策风险。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u30ba8d1d\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"uf47fa205\" data-lake-id=\"u61ef8b8a\" id=\"u61ef8b8a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u97fa7b68\" id=\"u97fa7b68\">技术解决方案</span></strong></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u6551a4ab\" id=\"u6551a4ab\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1752227542257-db64c4d5-cc80-4f70-8348-3e3f7d99250a.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u75a78bfb-3abf-4f02-ac9f-4497aef82f9%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ue1bb1560-9587-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A542.6666666666666%2C%22height%22%3A367%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A228841%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A814%2C%22originHeight%22%3A550%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%A4%9A%E6%A8%A1%E6%80%81%E8%9E%8D%E5%90%88%22%2C%22x%22%3A627%2C%22y%22%3A230%2C%22width%22%3A144%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%87%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2~%22%2C%22x%22%3A332%2C%22y%22%3A187%2C%22width%22%3A160%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%8A%BD%E5%8F%96%22%2C%22x%22%3A601%2C%22y%22%3A10%2C%22width%22%3A113%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%AD%A5%E9%AA%A4%E6%8B%86%E8%A7%A3%22%2C%22x%22%3A601%2C%22y%22%3A322%2C%22width%22%3A1